  Mode: 57
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Broadside
  Description: 'Every hull that can fight, loose in the Boneyard, each with the weapon it actually has
    - a Scarab''s plate, a Stoat''s joust, a Brittle Star''s cord, a Meerkat''s zap, an
    Angler''s bite. A hit is worth what it cost you to land, not what you flew: a round is
    1, a contact strike 8, a debuff 12, a rocket up to 30. First team to the target wins.
    Pick the hull you fight best.'
